285
00:11:02,448 --> 00:11:04,344
-Uh, Houston,
we've got a problem.

286
00:11:04,379 --> 00:11:08,172
-Urbana to car 254.
Come in, car 254.

287
00:11:10,931 --> 00:11:13,310
