-What happened?

324
00:12:53,379 --> 00:12:56,000
-Look, lady, just detour.
Will you, please?

325
00:12:56,034 --> 00:12:57,689
-Don't make me pull you
from your car

326
00:12:57,724 --> 00:12:59,482
