327
00:13:01,724 --> 00:13:04,758
-Hmm.
-Hmm, quiet, smooth ride.

328
00:13:04,793 --> 00:13:06,310
-Turbo hydromatic.

329
00:13:06,344 --> 00:13:07,551
Oh, now they're going
to have to turn

330
00:13:07,586 --> 00:13:10,068
