screen around, too.

331
00:13:12,965 --> 00:13:15,068
-Guys, this is so not Illinois.

332
00:13:15,103 --> 00:13:17,620
-[Laughter]

333
00:13:17,827 --> 00:13:19,137
-Hm.

334
00:13:20,517 --> 00:13:22,931
