347
00:13:51,862 --> 00:13:54,448
-Well, that surely doesn't
include the press.

348
00:13:54,482 --> 00:13:56,241
-I'm sorry, ma'am.

349
00:13:56,275 --> 00:13:58,310
No one is what the old man said.-Good job today, Lance.

350
00:13:58,344 --> 00:13:59,758
Carry on.

351
00:13:59,793 --> 00:14:02,000
-Well, was it very bad?
-So ashamed.

