358
00:14:15,655 --> 00:14:18,827
-He likes me.
I think we're dating.

359
00:14:18,862 --> 00:14:20,275
-Oh, I locked my keys
in the car.

360
00:14:20,310 --> 00:14:21,965
What the -- Oh.

361
00:14:23,793 --> 00:14:26,172
[Humming]

362
00:14:26,206 --> 00:14:27,551
