387
00:15:18,344 --> 00:15:19,551
-That's right.
-Well, I hated it!

388
00:15:19,586 --> 00:15:21,310
-I read the book you wrote
after the war.

389
00:15:21,344 --> 00:15:23,655
Liked it very much.
-Well, thank you.

390
00:15:23,689 --> 00:15:26,448
-You're with
National Wire Service now.

391
00:15:26,482 --> 00:15:27,931
-I was on my way
to Chanute Field

392
00:15:27,965 --> 00:15:30,758
