jet plane they're unveiling,

393
00:15:30,793 --> 00:15:32,758
and I ran into a roadblock.

394
00:15:32,793 --> 00:15:33,896
-So?

395
00:15:33,931 --> 00:15:35,241
-Yeah, you're right.
What was I thinking?

396
00:15:35,275 --> 00:15:38,344
-Captain, there was a town
beyond that roadblock,

397
00:15:38,379 --> 00:15:40,275
a town that isn't there anymore.

398
00:15:40,310 --> 00:15:42,103
-Until we find out
exactly what happened,

399
00:15:42,137 --> 00:15:44,241
we'd like to avoid publicity.

400
00:15:44,275 --> 00:15:46,655
-You have any idea
what happened?

401
00:15:46,689 --> 00:15:48,551
-I'm sorry, Miss Aimes.
-Maybe after this whole

402
00:15:48,586 --> 00:15:49,896
cover-up,
we can have coffee some time?

403
00:15:49,931 --> 00:15:52,482
-Captain, you can't suppress
a story like this.

404
00:15:52,517 --> 00:15:54,103
