409
00:16:01,655 --> 00:16:02,965
-You have my word.

410
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,448
-God, your hair
smells wonderful.

411
00:16:04,482 --> 00:16:05,724
-Sometime during the night,

412
00:16:05,758 --> 00:16:08,206
