415
00:16:12,862 --> 00:16:15,034
-Vanished?
-No bodies, nothing.

416
00:16:15,068 --> 00:16:16,965
-It was some
David Copperfield stunt.

417
00:16:17,000 --> 00:16:18,241
-Well, there must be
some trace.

418
00:16:18,275 --> 00:16:19,862
-I know it's hard to believe,
Miss Aimes.

419
00:16:19,896 --> 00:16:21,931
-But I'm Koko Taylor!
-Special detail combed through

420
00:16:21,965 --> 00:16:24,758
