424
00:16:29,827 --> 00:16:33,517
-150 people just don't
vanish into thin air.

425
00:16:33,551 --> 00:16:36,034
-We're still trying to
find out what happened.

426
00:16:36,068 --> 00:16:38,103
If you'd like to sit in.

427
00:16:38,137 --> 00:16:39,206
-Thank you. I would.

428
00:16:39,241 --> 00:16:41,793
-I've got a clarinet in my car.

429
00:16:43,068 --> 00:16:44,620
-Hey.

430
00:16:44,655 --> 00:16:46,068
[Grunting]

431
00:16:46,103 --> 00:16:49,896
-Dave, what time did you
leave Ludlow last night?

432
00:16:49,931 --> 00:16:52,310
-Must have been after 11:00.

433
00:16:52,344 --> 00:16:54,034
-Arnold Ziffel's father!
-My father-in-law was watching

434
00:16:54,068 --> 00:16:56,724
