435
00:16:56,758 --> 00:16:58,137
-Then I caught "Letterman."

436
00:16:58,172 --> 00:17:00,931
-And my daughter wanted me
to sit there and talk a while.

437
00:17:00,965 --> 00:17:03,310
Then I got to thinking
that I had to get up early.

438
00:17:03,344 --> 00:17:04,862
-Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
Your point, please?

439
00:17:04,896 --> 00:17:06,551
-So I took off.

440
00:17:06,586 --> 00:17:08,034
-Did you notice
anything strange...

441
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:09,482
-[As Grandpa Munster] Hoiman!
-...about the house

442
00:17:09,517 --> 00:17:11,172
