466
00:17:51,137 --> 00:17:53,310
-Andrew Jackson!
-Old Hickory!

467
00:17:53,344 --> 00:17:56,517
-I phoned the company linesmen
to go out there right away.

468
00:17:56,551 --> 00:17:58,310
