470
00:18:01,586 --> 00:18:03,862
-Yes, yes, is that
what you want?

471
00:18:03,896 --> 00:18:05,689
-All right, thanks.
You've been very helpful.

472
00:18:05,724 --> 00:18:07,793
-Man, she's a tough old bird.

473
00:18:07,827 --> 00:18:08,862
-Okay, bye.

474
00:18:08,896 --> 00:18:11,000
-Oh, Colonel Sturgeon,
Miss Aimes,

475
00:18:11,034 --> 00:18:13,206
National Wire Service.
-How do you do?

476
00:18:13,241 --> 00:18:15,551
-Audrey Aimes, I've read a lot
