-Reading your cleavage now.

478
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:18,689
Oh.

479
00:18:18,724 --> 00:18:19,724
-Yello?
-Yes?

480
00:18:19,758 --> 00:18:21,655
-Set to go, sir,
whenever you're ready.

481
00:18:21,689 --> 00:18:22,758
-I'll be right there.

482
00:18:22,793 --> 00:18:24,034
-I got to pick up Phil
at play practice.

483
00:18:24,068 --> 00:18:25,344
-I hope you understand
our problem,

484
00:18:25,379 --> 00:18:27,275
