485
00:18:27,310 --> 00:18:28,551
-Yes.
Captain briefed me.

486
00:18:28,586 --> 00:18:30,000
-Then he pantsed me.
-If anyone wants me,

487
00:18:30,034 --> 00:18:32,000
I can be reached
in Ludlow by radio.

488
00:18:32,034 --> 00:18:33,068
-Yes, sir.

489
00:18:33,103 --> 00:18:34,551
-How's chances of me
going along?

490
00:18:34,586 --> 00:18:36,413
-Not this trip. Maybe later.
-Baby later?

491
00:18:36,448 --> 00:18:38,413
-Any case, not until we know
what's out there.

492
00:18:38,448 --> 00:18:40,586
-Well, by the way, Colonel,
my camera was taken from me

493
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:42,241
