be worrying about a big story.

1943
01:13:31,413 --> 01:13:32,896
-I'm not worried about a story.

1944
01:13:32,931 --> 01:13:34,724
-Look, I just want
to drop my A-bombs.

1945
01:13:34,758 --> 01:13:36,689
-Will you please leave before
it's too late?

1946
01:13:36,724 --> 01:13:37,827
-No.

1947
01:13:37,862 --> 01:13:39,000
-Major?
-Hmm?

1948
01:13:39,034 --> 01:13:40,482
-You and a detail of two men
will remain here

1949
01:13:40,517 --> 01:13:42,103
with Mr. Wainwright.
-Mm-hmm.

1950
01:13:42,137 --> 01:13:44,862
-I will station men
at three observation posts,

1951
01:13:44,896 --> 01:13:46,655
one in the suburbs,

1952
01:13:46,689 --> 01:13:47,896
one near the Art Institute...

1953
01:13:47,931 --> 01:13:48,965
-Mm-hmm.
-...and one top

1954
01:13:49,000 --> 01:13:50,034
of the downtown hotel.

1955
01:13:50,068 --> 01:13:51,241
-And one on top of me.

1956
01:13:51,275 --> 01:13:53,517
-Also, a helicopter will spot
from above.

1957
01:13:53,551 --> 01:13:55,379
There will be a getaway car
parked downstairs

1958
01:13:55,413 --> 01:13:57,103
at the main entrance.

1959
01:13:57,137 --> 01:13:58,551
I suggest you use it by...

1960
01:13:58,586 --> 01:14:02,034
-Oh, 8:00, I guess.
-...by 5:45 at the very latest.

1961
01:14:02,068 --> 01:14:05,379
If you are successful,
contact me at once

1962
01:14:05,413 --> 01:14:07,103
so I can stop the bomb.

1963
01:14:09,482 --> 01:14:11,689
-Just a little bowl
of wheat, please!

1964
01:14:11,724 --> 01:14:13,034
Oh!

1965
01:14:13,068 --> 01:14:16,758
-It's oh-five, um, uh...

1966
01:14:16,793 --> 01:14:18,827
-Well, good morning.
You got the Loop here.

1967
01:14:18,862 --> 01:14:20,448
It's going to be
a nice day today.

1968
01:14:20,482 --> 01:14:22,620
We're going to get bombed.
You probably heard about that.

1969
01:14:22,655 --> 01:14:23,724
-They're scraping the grills

1970
01:14:23,758 --> 01:14:25,344
at The Billy Goat
at this very moment.

1971
01:14:25,379 --> 01:14:26,310
-Mmm.

1972
01:14:26,344 --> 01:14:28,517
[Machine whirring]

1973
01:14:28,551 --> 01:14:31,827
-I'm a gr -- grasshopper.
That's all I am, honest.

1974
01:14:31,862 --> 01:14:34,275
[Whirring continues]

1975
01:14:34,310 --> 01:14:35,620
It's "Sweet Lorraine."

1976
01:14:35,655 --> 01:14:38,000
-Do I really have to
stay here for this?

1977
01:14:41,379 --> 01:14:43,448
-Huh, so, uh,
where's the razzmatazz?

1978
01:14:43,482 --> 01:14:44,379
I don't see it, hmm.

1979
01:14:44,413 --> 01:14:47,413
-Hm. Nope.

1980
01:14:47,448 --> 01:14:51,344
-[As Jack Lemmon] I've got to
have those Glengarry leads.

1981
01:14:51,379 --> 01:14:53,206
-Have you ever associated
with crickets?

1982
01:14:53,241 --> 01:14:54,689
Have you ever taken part
in a plague?

1983
01:14:54,724 --> 01:14:56,172
-No!
-Have you eaten crops in excess

1984
01:14:56,206 --> 01:14:57,413
of $1 million?!

1985
01:14:57,448 --> 01:14:59,655
-[Sobbing]

1986
01:14:59,689 --> 01:15:01,862
-That damn Tandy equipment.

1987
01:15:01,896 --> 01:15:05,103
[Machine whirring]

1988
01:15:08,655 --> 01:15:11,103
-Folks, as for traffic today,
there's none.

1989
01:15:11,137 --> 01:15:12,827
Can't explain it.
[Chuckles]

1990
01:15:12,862 --> 01:15:14,620
What do you know?

1991
01:15:16,206 --> 01:15:17,586
-Boy, the convention business

1992
01:15:17,620 --> 01:15:19,379
just went straight downhill,
didn't it?

1993
01:15:19,413 --> 01:15:21,413
-Wow.

1994
01:15:22,620 --> 01:15:24,758
Look at that.

1995
01:15:24,793 --> 01:15:28,034
[Machine whirring]

1996
01:15:28,068 --> 01:15:30,551
-What in the Sam Hill
is he doing?

1997
01:15:31,620 --> 01:15:33,655
-I'm not going to admit
my failure.

1998
01:15:36,137 --> 01:15:38,413
-Well, it's shaping up to be
a pretty nice day.

1999
01:15:38,448 --> 01:15:40,034
Maybe go get some
Christmas shopping done.

2000
01:15:40,068 --> 01:15:41,724
Not a lot of competition.

2001
01:15:41,758 --> 01:15:44,000
[Machine whirring]

2002
01:15:44,034 --> 01:15:46,448
-It's a long
Kathleen Battle aria.

2003
01:15:46,482 --> 01:15:48,827
-Well, maybe he's innocent.Maybe they got the wrong hopper.

2004
01:15:48,862 --> 01:15:50,000
-Hmm.

2005
01:15:50,931 --> 01:15:53,034
-D'oh, I forgot
to turn this thing on.

2006
01:15:53,068 --> 01:15:55,275
[Machine whirring]

2007
01:15:55,310 --> 01:15:57,965
-[Imitating whirring]

2008
01:16:01,137 --> 01:16:02,344
-Hey, look at this.

2009
01:16:02,379 --> 01:16:05,344
-He's got high blood pressure.

2010
01:16:05,379 --> 01:16:06,689
-I think you've got it!

2011
01:16:06,724 --> 01:16:08,620
-This is what it sounds like
