2012
01:16:08,655 --> 01:16:09,758
-That's it, Audrey,
we've got it.

2013
01:16:09,793 --> 01:16:11,379
-My jaw jigging...

2014
01:16:11,413 --> 01:16:13,551
[Laughing]

2015
01:16:13,586 --> 01:16:15,517
-[Screams]

2016
01:16:15,551 --> 01:16:17,862
-Whoa.
-Oh.

2017
01:16:19,241 --> 01:16:20,586
-Oh, no, not the face!

2018
01:16:20,620 --> 01:16:23,344
You took out
a couple thousand eyes!

2019
01:16:23,379 --> 01:16:26,310
-Pete, Pete, short,
controlled bursts!

2020
01:16:28,137 --> 01:16:31,517
-Hey, I've got it.
We could just shoot them.

2021
01:16:31,551 --> 01:16:33,827
-Ah, well, acceptable losses.

2022
01:16:38,517 --> 01:16:40,275
-I had to shoot him.

2023
01:16:42,344 --> 01:16:45,000
-Well, let's chocolate dip
that grasshopper.

2024
01:16:46,413 --> 01:16:48,206
-Get that thing out of here.

2025
01:16:48,241 --> 01:16:49,827
-Bug fell and hit his head
against the bars

2026
01:16:49,862 --> 01:16:52,310
if anyone asks, right?

2027
01:16:52,344 --> 01:16:53,413
-Well, back at it.

2028
01:16:53,448 --> 01:16:54,931
I want to polygraph
the doorknob now.

2029
01:16:54,965 --> 01:16:58,206
-Emergency Lab to Chicago GHQ.
Emergency Lab to Chicago GHQ.

2030
01:16:58,241 --> 01:17:00,206
Come in, General.
Are you there?

2031
01:17:00,241 --> 01:17:01,586
-Now listen to me, Wainwright.

2032
01:17:01,620 --> 01:17:04,068
-We've found it, General.
We've found the frequency.

2033
01:17:04,103 --> 01:17:05,689
-Hmm.
-Good.

2034
01:17:05,724 --> 01:17:07,379
Now stand by.

2035
01:17:07,413 --> 01:17:09,655
I've got to stop that A-bomb.

2036
01:17:09,689 --> 01:17:11,551
I'll get right back to you.

2037
01:17:11,586 --> 01:17:15,517
Chicago GHQ to Double B.
Chicago GHQ to Double B.

2038
01:17:18,103 --> 01:17:19,689
Chicago GHQ to Double B, over.

2039
01:17:19,724 --> 01:17:21,241
-They're not going to let us
drop the bomb.

2040
01:17:21,275 --> 01:17:22,655
Don't answer it.

2041
01:17:22,689 --> 01:17:26,448
-This is Double B.
Come in, Chicago GHQ, over.

2042
01:17:26,482 --> 01:17:29,724
-Hanson here.
Your mission is canceled.

2043
01:17:29,758 --> 01:17:32,689
-Real sorry, boys.
-Return to your base.

2044
01:17:32,724 --> 01:17:35,379
Repeat the message, over.

2045
01:17:35,413 --> 01:17:37,413
