-Mission canceled.

2046
01:17:37,448 --> 01:17:38,931
Return to base, over.

2047
01:17:38,965 --> 01:17:42,517
-Repeat it again.
-Chicago GHQ to emergency lab.

2048
01:17:42,551 --> 01:17:44,172
-Right here.

2049
01:17:44,206 --> 01:17:46,758
-The show is yours, Wainwright.

2050
01:17:46,793 --> 01:17:49,034
-All right, get that equipment
on the lake in a boat,

2051
01:17:49,068 --> 01:17:50,827
