2162
01:21:52,724 --> 01:21:53,517
[High-pitched whirring]

2163
01:21:53,551 --> 01:21:55,068
I don't remember that.

2164
01:21:55,103 --> 01:21:57,034
-Post number one
to emergency lab.

2165
01:21:57,068 --> 01:21:58,620
The locusts are leaving
this section.

2166
01:21:58,655 --> 01:22:00,172
They're heading towards
Chicago's downtown.

2167
01:22:00,206 --> 01:22:02,000
-If they wanted to rev up
the grasshoppers,

2168
01:22:02,034 --> 01:22:03,413
