played some Marvin Gaye.

2169
01:22:03,448 --> 01:22:05,034
-Yeah.
-Helicopter to emergency lab.

2170
01:22:05,068 --> 01:22:06,310
-I'm still Paul Frees.

2171
01:22:06,344 --> 01:22:09,172
-The locusts are moving
on the downtown area.

2172
01:22:09,206 --> 01:22:11,034
