2174
01:22:15,517 --> 01:22:18,034
-So does this, uh, bus, uh,
go all the way to...

2175
01:22:18,068 --> 01:22:20,310
-Just get on the bus!
-Oh.

2176
01:22:24,172 --> 01:22:26,862
-We've got to get
organized, Hoppy!

2177
01:22:29,931 --> 01:22:32,965
-Observation post number three
to emergency lab.

2178
01:22:33,000 --> 01:22:35,310
The locusts are everywhere.

2179
01:22:35,344 --> 01:22:36,896
-Yep, over there, too,
everywhere pretty much.

2180
01:22:36,931 --> 01:22:38,827
-They're moving
towards your location.

2181
01:22:38,862 --> 01:22:40,758
I repeat, the locusts
are moving toward

2182
01:22:40,793 --> 01:22:42,137
the emergency lab.

2183
01:22:42,172 --> 01:22:45,655
-They've gotten ahold
of firearms, and they're drunk.

2184
01:22:45,689 --> 01:22:47,344
-Michigan Boulevard
is filled with them!

2185
